OL,3,GNEWSAScenes of 'mayhem' after fatal
OL,4,Acrash near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living close to the scene of
OL,7,Fa fatal multi-car crash near Edinburgh
OL,8,FAirport have described scenes of
OL,9,F"mayhem" in the aftermath of the
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FVehicles were said to be "strewn across
OL,13,Ftwo lanes" following the crash
OL,14,Finvolving a grey Mercedes A250, a black
OL,15,FRenault Captur, a grey Skoda Karoq and
OL,16,Fa grey Hyundai i30 on the A8 Glasgow
OL,17,FRoad at about 09:25 on Monday.
OL,19,FA 58-year-old woman, who was driving
OL,20,Fthe Hyundai, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
